{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act47side_level_act47side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act47side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act47side_level_act47side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"UR-4","storyName":"晴空湍流","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"斯凯找到高登的前上司古斯塔夫，试图向他告发高登却反被其扣押。娜斯提放弃了莱茵的工程主导权和参展权，保下了斯凯和许多被抛弃的体验员。另一边，高登威胁费尔南二人与他达成秘密交易。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act47side/level_act47side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act47side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["行政秘书","斯凯","？？？","古斯塔夫","奥克里","费尔南","园区警卫","高登","梅希亚","太空鳞兽","体验员A","体验员B","娜斯提"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7E/Avg_bg_68_g7_airrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","id":9},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","isblock":"false","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":15},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行政秘书","text":"我说了，你不能进去。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我也说了，我隶属于莱茵生命，比你更清楚园区设施的管理规定，进入云中餐厅根本不需要特殊权限。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行政秘书","text":"平时是不需要，但现在里面有贵客。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":22},{"type":"dialog","id":23},{"type":"charslot","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"让他进来吧，这位年轻人应该是来找我的。","id":25},{"type":"dialog","id":26},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":27},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":28},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0","id":30},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":31},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_creepy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":32,"musicid":1},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":33},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"看来莱茵生态园的事故已经处理完了？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"古斯塔夫先生的消息真灵通。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"哈哈，只是恰好有几个熟人在这个园区为哥伦比亚的新事业尽忠职守。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"其中包括高登·谭农？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"看来你来这里，并非为了替莱茵挽回损失。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"就算越级申请应急补助，也无法让莱茵赶上展会。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"请您先看看这份检查报告。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":51},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"1.3","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"一家新兴科技公司为了留在园区，紧急解决了检修时发现的工程缺陷......有什么问题？","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"“幸运瘤兽”根本没有通过工程复检，按规定在今天之内必须撤出园区。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"但就在刚才，我见到了他们的经理，发现困扰了他们数月之久的供能问题，已经被完全解决了。","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"展会在即，死限、科学、奇迹......“薯片的经典口味”而已。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"不，您看这一页——","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我额外关注了几个常规检查中不会涉及的元件，它们的输出功率均高出额定功率十倍不止。呃，简单点说——","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"不用解释那些名词，年轻人。你随身带着的那本《哥伦比亚源石元件制式与标准》还是由我主导拟定的。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"你是想说，“幸运瘤兽”在短短几小时内，“发明”了远超整个国家通行标准的动力元件？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"“发明”？他们没那个本事。我认为，有人为那只活不下来的蠢物移植了一颗不属于哥伦比亚的新心脏。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"年轻人，你知道园区的规定。现在各个国家都在关注我们在浮空技术领域的进展，为保障安全，所有零件只能是哥伦比亚制造。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"不用紧张，古斯塔夫先生，这并不是管理局的失职。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"普通的执行专员怎么可能让企业躲过莱茵的定期检查和不定期抽检，除非有人能操纵工程部的检修顺序。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"巧的是，娜斯提主任正好跟一位长官达成了协议......","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"高登·谭农。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"那家伙千方百计地想要捆住莱茵的手脚，因为我们才是“螺旋桨天堂”真正的发起方，工程部是一双随时可能发现他秘密的眼睛。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"所以你猜测，高登·谭农非但没有当好管理者，反倒监守自盗，做起了“供应商”？","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"这是很严重的指控，年轻人。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9F/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"所以我才只能找您，古斯塔夫先生。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"在园区抵达特区之前，只有您才有心也有力对付这个“尽忠职守”的下属。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":94},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"我突然好奇一件事——你的上司知道这件事吗？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"如果娜斯提主任能有所作为，莱茵生命何至于现在......","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"那就好。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"唔，什么意思？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"难得遇见你这样敏锐又勇敢的年轻人。娜斯提如果知道的话，恐怕不会同意你留下来陪我一段时间。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":104},{"type":"charslot","id":105},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorbreak","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$1","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":107},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"-30,0","duration":"0.5","focus":"m","isblock":"false","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"30,0","duration":"0.5","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-30","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"0.3","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":112},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#11$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"古斯塔夫——","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E2/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"charslot","id":117},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#2$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"只有我才“有心也有力”对付高登......哈哈，有趣的说法。早年间他确实经常和我作对，但那只是年轻人的一时莽撞，正如你。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2042_1#3$1","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"而我教给他的第一条规矩就是：代表哥伦比亚时，我们永远是一体的。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2042_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-30,0","posto":"-30,0","isblock":"false","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"30,0","posto":"30,0","isblock":"true","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#6$1","posfrom":"0,-30","posto":"0,-30","focus":"m","isblock":"true","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你......！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","volume":"0.3","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":129},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_woodfloor_fts","volume":"1","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"年轻的莱茵研究员看着古斯塔夫从自己腰间抽走了那份检查报告，转身走进了餐厅深处。","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"他错愕、愤怒，想要冲上前去，可对方只是摆了摆手，保镖们加重力气，反剪他的双手，让他发出不甘心的痛呼。","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$phonevibration","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"哪位？","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古斯塔夫","text":"......哈哈，这不是巧合吧？","id":138},{"type":"text","text":"斯凯被保镖们押着往外走，不知自己会被押进园区下层的监狱还是某个密室。","id":139},{"type":"text","text":"恍惚间，他听到古斯塔夫接了个电话，想必老家伙正给高登通风报信。斯凯有些后悔没有把证据留给娜斯提主任。要是能回到生态园——","id":140},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_elevator_arrive","volume":"0.8","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"突然间，疼痛消失了。保镖们松开了手，将他赶进了离开云中餐厅的电梯。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":143},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":146},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":147},{"type":"charslot","id":148},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_bg_bg_cellroomB.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":150},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":152},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":153,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_knockdoorfast","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"1.8","id":155},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"嘿——！门外的大哥你听得见我说话吗！","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"我发誓，高登长官走私源石制品的事我绝对不会说出去，我们真的不是故意闯进他的收藏室的！","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"40,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"歇一会儿吧，奥克里，再说下去他们就会觉得只有死人的嘴才是最严的了。","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"呜......","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"哎，怎么又哭起来了？放心，冷处理囚犯是常事。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1F/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"说得好像你经常被抓进牢里一样......","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你以为我是从哪儿练得的口才？","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"就算遇到的是言语不通、手握长矛围堵我的阿达克利斯人，我也能挤眉弄眼地比划出个所以然来。","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"你真的觉得我们有可能从牢里出去？","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"你去过骸骨荒原吗？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"没有......听说那里的风沙能穿透最坚固的铁皮，探险家们会在遭遇风暴的一瞬被剔为骸骨。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"没错，所有导游都相信禁区之所以被称为禁区自有道理，没有一家旅行社会把它当作目的地。","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"但我不想凭一些道听途说就将它定义为“不可能”。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"你不会去了吧......那你还能毫发无伤地出来？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那里就是一片灰色沙漠。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"毒辣的太阳把沙子照得发亮，山坡后面有暗紫色的断壁，仙人掌比你我都高。","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"它确实危险，狂风肆虐的时候人无法分清脚下的是地面还是空洞，不过沙子的锐利程度远比不上刀片。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3C/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"不可思议......","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"“‘不可能’是人们为胆怯和懒惰找的借口。”——我爸常把这句话挂在嘴边。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"正是因为他，我才成了一名与众不同的、敢于闯入禁区的导游。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"真羡慕你有这样支持你的父亲。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5E/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"嗯，是啊......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"所以，打起精神来吧，奥克里。那名女妖客人和你的心愿我都会达成的，我们的旅途远没有结束。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","id":205},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"喂，你们。","id":208},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"40,0","focus":"r","id":211},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"你、你们要做什么！别过来！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shackle_unlock","volume":"0.8","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#8$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"40,0","focus":"r","id":220},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#3$1","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"50,0","focus":"r","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"......怎么回事？","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"老实点跟我走，高登长官要见你们。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"我说的对吧？这里还不是终点。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"charslot","id":233},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_38_g2_colombiaoffice.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":235},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":236,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"是，我明白......给您添麻烦了长官。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_ringoff_long","volume":"1","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":245},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"*哥伦比亚粗口*那老狐狸训人的口气一点没变，能不能尊重一下哥伦比亚的法定退休年龄！","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"我可不再是以前那个只配给他买咖啡，要是加错糖还会被指着鼻子骂的毛头小子了！","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"高登长官......再给零五四投喂鳞粮，它就真的要撑得眼冒金星了......","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_marshbubble","volume":"1","id":255},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2040_1#1$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太空鳞兽","text":"（吐泡泡）","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3F/Avg_avg_npc_2040_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哼，你来喂。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_groceriespaper","volume":"0.2","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":265},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"......","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#4$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"一件顺心的事都没有。不仅没把碍事的莱茵彻底赶出园区，现在老狐狸和娜斯提的人还知道了我的生意......","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2A/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#7$1","id":270},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"更重要的是，我好不容易收集来的珍奇施术单元莫名其妙被两个混蛋毁了大半，里面有几件可是绝世孤品！","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#7$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"施术单元......生意......","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"长官，您之前没向我说明的那些空白的时间，其实都是在......走私？","id":275,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你认为帮助科技公司在天空占据一席之地，是违规行为？","id":277,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"不，我不会多嘴。但......","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"但您刚才派人带那两名闯入者过来，是打算处置他们吗？","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"你紧张什么？比起泄私愤，现在还有更重要的事情要让他们去做。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"没有确凿的证据，就没人能剥夺我对园区的管理权。收藏室剩余的装置需要尽快运出去，以防有人从中作梗。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您想让他们帮您把违禁品运出去？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#5$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"可所有进出园区的物资都需要经过严格的审核，就算有您的加急许可，依旧会被抽查，而且......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"而且原本的物流渠道受到工程部改造影响，必须暂停使用一段日子，我可等不了那么久。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#9$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"都怪娜斯提要搞什么能源系统改造，现在到处都是浮空种植单元和莱茵的人。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#6$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"等等，莱茵......","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#2$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"哈哈，好，既然你们堵了我的运输通道，那我也只能借用你们的了。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#11$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"您是说，莱茵生态园地下用来运输大型设备和基础建材的工程运输口？","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#1$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"没错，生态园被封锁，莱茵的地盘现在是最安全的掩护。老狐狸的动向我有把握，但娜斯提......","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#14$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"长官，只要您能保证那两位闯入者的安全，娜斯提主任可以交由我来处理。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DA/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2034_1#3$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高登","text":"嗯？就凭你？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/78/Avg_avg_npc_2034_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"我有把握能在您实行计划的时候引开她。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#15$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"只要您允许我借用一件您从费尔南小姐身上收缴来的东西——女妖的骨笔。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":310},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"dialog","id":312},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":313},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":315},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_bg_68_g14_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":316},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":317},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":318},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":319},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"你们两个走快一点，别让高登长官等急了。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":323},{"type":"charslot","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":325},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1000_1#2$1","focus":"r","isblock":"true","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥克里","text":"（小声）我们捣毁了长官的收藏室，他一定会向我们讨说法的！","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F0/Avg_avg_npc_1000_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":328},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"（小声）要是能用钱抵，倒还直截了当，就怕跟我们谈“交易”......","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"charslot","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","isblock":"true","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"到了。","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":334},{"type":"charslot","id":335},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":337},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":338},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":339},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":340},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_901_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"园区警卫","text":"梅希亚小姐，长官要的人带到了。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_901_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"辛苦了，先生，请您回去继续工作吧。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":348},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#4$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":349},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"梅希亚小姐，我的客人——","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"抱歉，高登长官似乎与您客人的失踪无关，我只能尽力帮您留意。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"那位女妖究竟跑到哪里去了......","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":357},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"暂时忘了她吧。如果你们还想离开这个园区，进门之后请务必听从高登长官的命令。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4214_cairn_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"费尔南","text":"......他到底要做什么？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_4214_cairn_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2037_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梅希亚","text":"他要跟你们谈一笔你们无法拒绝的“交易”。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_npc_2037_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":363},{"type":"dialog","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_bg_29_g4_corridor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":370},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":371},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":372},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act28side/m_avg_wasteland_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":373,"musicid":4},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":374},{"type":"text","text":"斯凯的脚步越走越慢。以往他习惯跑着经过这条走廊，同事总会半开玩笑地抱怨他性子太急。","id":375},{"type":"text","text":"可是，怎么能不急？","id":376},{"type":"text","text":"他与那些顺理成章升学深造的人不同，残破的家境让他不得不把许多时间浪费在研究之外的地方。","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"现在他终于站在莱茵生命的肩膀上，在哥伦比亚应用科学领域的顶端，即将触摸那片见证过奇迹的穹顶。","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"任何阻碍都不该存在，无人有资格牵绊一项伟大的事业。","id":379},{"type":"dialog","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我得把高登的秘密告诉主任，然后......再向她道歉。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"charslot","id":384},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chaoticfootstep_indoor","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":385},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":387},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":388},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"脚步声？莱茵的研究员不是已经撤出实验区了吗？","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":392},{"type":"charslot","id":393},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":394},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":395},{"type":"dialog","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":399},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_bg_68_g13_ecolabwithered.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":400},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":402},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2044_1#1$1","id":403},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2045_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":405},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"哎，这东西能不能拆下来啊？看着有点像浮空回转酒吧的离心力安全防护膜。","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员B","text":"手别乱动，一会儿问问我们的新雇主。","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"娜斯提小姐还没从办公室出来？","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员A","text":"听说为了救我们和那个凶着脸的小子，她连这座生态园都不要了。","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E9/Avg_avg_npc_2045_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"体验员B","text":"嘘，我们只要知道娜斯提小姐是个好人就可以了，别多嘴。","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/67/Avg_avg_npc_2044_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#5$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"凶着脸的小子......我？","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"charslot","id":421},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":423},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行政秘书","text":"感谢您能抽出时间，愿我们合作愉快。","id":424},{"type":"dialog","id":425},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1260_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"-20,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"false","id":428},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":429},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":430},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"20,0","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":432},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#12$1","focus":"l","isblock":"true","id":433},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你是古斯塔夫身边的那个秘书？你来做什么！","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行政秘书","text":"哦，原来你就是那个斯凯·杰格......","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":437},{"type":"dialogue","name":"行政秘书","text":"我跟娜斯提主任已经谈完了，先行一步。","id":438,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_1260_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":439},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts","volume":"1","id":440},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":441},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":442},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":443},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":445,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":446},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":447},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"20,0","duration":"1.8","isblock":"true","id":448},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"你回来了。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你向古斯塔夫道歉了？","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"是。","id":454,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":455},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你完全让出了工程主导权，不再主动开展核查？","id":456,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":457},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"是。","id":458,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":459},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"莱茵生命实质上已经退出此次展会，并且不会出现在场刊名录中？","id":460,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":461},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"是。","id":462,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":463},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":464,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D6/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":465},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"一会儿这里需要堆放整理完的实验器材，你要是还有力气就来搭把手。","id":466,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":467},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"主任......","id":468,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":469},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"嗯？","id":470,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":471},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你早就知道我会闯祸，也早就看清了我只是个平庸的人，所以才用工程检修和种植单元搪塞我，对吗？","id":472,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":473},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"你的判断是准确的，到头来我自己也不过是阴沟里的鼷兽，只能理解伟大却不能变成其中的一部分。","id":474,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"被原谅，被拯救，受庇护......我与这满屋子的体验员一样，是被远远甩在后面的普通人，如果没有你的帮助，现在也不会留在这里。","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D9/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":477},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我需要一批新的雇员，也需要一个助手，仅此而已。","id":478,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/30/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"刚来哥伦比亚时，我被一群拓荒者收留。他们嫌弃我身为女妖却不擅使用咒言，我嫌弃他们制作的捕猎笼效率太低。","id":480,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我们的交流中从来不存在被动语态——我们总是互相原谅，互相拯救，互相庇护。","id":482,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":483},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"就像现在一样，就像本来应该的那样。","id":484,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":485},{"type":"charslot","id":486},{"type":"text","text":"此刻的生态园依然静悄悄的，但体验员的加入似乎让这座原本充斥着理性和金属气息的实验室变得不太一样。","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"总是很难抠开的玻片收纳盒上，多了一个用歪歪扭扭的铁丝做成的拉环；总是冷得让人脊背发凉的出风口下，挂了一块挡风的胶合板。","id":488},{"type":"text","text":"斯凯生气的时候总会撞上的玻璃门，上面多了几张写着“小心”的便签。","id":489},{"type":"text","text":"那些便签让他想起了自己的妹妹——","id":490},{"type":"text","text":"那个平庸的、普通的，在他眼中总是需要“被保护”的人。","id":491},{"type":"text","text":"那个他自从见证伟大的奇迹之后，就再也没有回头看过的人。","id":492},{"type":"dialog","id":493},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","duration":"0.8","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","duration":"0.8","isblock":"true","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"如果前进意味着不能回头，那我们如何确认自己走在最初选择的道路上？","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"如果进步意味着筛选，只有少数人能去往的未来，有何意义？","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DB/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"斯凯，为什么普通人就应当被甩在后面？","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":502},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"......","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2039_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斯凯","text":"我从来不知道你......如此擅长演讲。","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_2039_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"我只会陈述事实。发问，再解决，如此循环。","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4212_nasti_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":508},{"type":"dialogue","name":"娜斯提","text":"在伟大的道理和理想哄骗你的头脑之前，动起来。","id":509,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/72/Avg_avg_4212_nasti_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":510},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":512},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":513},{"type":"charslot","id":514},{"type":"background","id":515},{"type":"image","id":516}],"characters":["行政秘书","斯凯","？？？","古斯塔夫","奥克里","费尔南","园区警卫","高登","梅希亚","太空鳞兽","体验员A","体验员B","娜斯提"]}